    "findings": [
      "The first two source fixtures leave recorded action_envelope_json NULL and current policy_binding None. Incoming native_review_binding_matches now rejects current None before examining the envelope.",
      "The concurrent-consumer test uses a shared worker that now records a typed native receipt and policy binding, but each direct store consumption omits policy_binding.",
