      "The legacy artifact-hash negative bypasses both shared helpers and therefore needs explicit recorded/current binding in its direct insert/API call.",
      "The policy-mismatch test should vary only the policy digest of an otherwise complete equal domain, retain zero effects after mismatch, then matching success and one-use refusal.",
      "Three distinct missing-side cases must cover missing recorded only, missing current only, and both missing, each asserting refusal and zero continuation effects.",
      "The concurrent-consumer test must extract the actual request envelope binding, retain the two-thread barrier, and preserve sorted(results) == [False, True]."
